  "rsaTitle": "VII",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/nh-rsa-data/blob/96bd0a247d4463e2ae692310c0fdd17ec563a46c/rsa_html/VII/105/105-7.htm",
  "statuteText": "105:7 Approval, Etc. –\n\nSuch regulations shall not take effect until they have been approved by the selectmen, and, together with such approval, have been recorded by the town clerk, nor until they have been published in some newspaper printed in the town, or, if there be none, until they have been posted in 2 or more public places in the town."
}
